    <item>
      <title>中国における脊髄損傷の疾病負担の経年推移・要因分解・2050年までの将来予測</title>
      <link>https://bearorange0202.github.io/rehab-paper-digest/articles/2026/09/secular-trends-decomposition-and-projections-of-spinal-cord-injury-burden-in-chi/</link>
